{"task_id": "HumanEval/50", "solution": "def decode_shift(s: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    takes as input string encoded with encode_shift function. Returns decoded string.\n    Only lowercase English alphabetic characters are shifted.\n    \"\"\"\n    decoded_chars = []\n    for ch in s:\n        if 'a' <= ch <= 'z':\n            shifted_char = chr(((ord(ch) - 5 - ord(\"a\")) % 26) + ord(\"a\"))\n            decoded_chars.append(shifted_char)\n        else:\n            decoded_chars.append(ch)\n    return \"\".join(decoded_chars)"}
